E-mail from outside the company doesn't normally reach me, but somehow a
few pieces of mail have found their way through asking for more info
about this.  Mainly asking about eating non-metal rings.  Gelatinous
cubes can eat some rings, but many rings can't be eaten by anything 
(as far as I know).  The following shows exactly who can eat what:

Ring Name   Material   Eaten by
---------   --------   --------
wooden      wood       Gelatinous cubes
granite     mineral
black onyx  mineral
moonstone   mineral
tiger eye   gemstone
jade        gemstone
agate       gemstone
topaz       gemstone
sapphire    gemstone
ruby        gemstone
diamond     gemstone
pearl       iron       Metallivores
iron        iron       Metallivores
brass       copper     Metallivores
copper      copper     Metallivores
silver      silver     Metallivores
gold        gold       Metallivores
ivory       0          Gelatinous cubes
emerald     gemstone
wire        iron       Metallivores
engagement  iron       Metallivores

There are three monsters which are Metalivores: 
  - rock moles
  - rust monster
  - xorn

